  <name>Dictator</name>
  <summary>Hold a shortcut, speak, paste the transcript</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Dictator turns a keyboard shortcut into dictation that works in any window.
      Hold the shortcut, speak, release it, and the transcript is copied to the
      clipboard ready to paste.
    </p>
    <p>
      Speech is transcribed on your own machine with whisper.cpp. No account, no
      subscription, and no audio leaves your computer. Models are downloaded once
      from Hugging Face and reused offline after that; you can pick between smaller
      fast models and larger accurate ones from inside the app.
    </p>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.aradar46.Dictator.desktop</launchable>

